{
  "$description": "RETIRED (2026-09): the 'broadsheet' direction was claimed by DESIGN.md and never built -- there is no /v/broadsheet route, no components/broadsheet/ tree, no npm script that builds this file and no emitted CSS anywhere in the repo. Kept as the record of the pass beside design/build-tokens.mjs, not as a source of truth for any shipped surface. The live value authority is components/blocks/style/base/tokens.css for the shipped 'blocks' direction. tidycrm variant B 'broadsheet'. DTCG tokens, 3-tier (primitive -> semantic -> component), derived from design-systems/library/wired/DESIGN.md via the Library Contract in taste/aesthetic-systems.md. The source palette is six values and the source has exactly one shadow token; both facts are preserved. Built by design/build-tokens.mjs.",
